 a rough adaptation of the first four chapters of the Guyver manga. It covers the same basic elements of these chapters; Genesis of the guyver, Fight with Vamore, Fight with Guyver 2 and the introduction of Guyver 3. Main differences are the exclusion of Tetsuro and his replacement by Mizuki, The replacement of Lisker with a female Agent \"Valcuria\", and thus a female Guyver 2. There is also a look at Sho's psychology of how he deals with his situation including a very harsh moment where his friends are assassinated in cold blood.\n\nOne night, high school student Sho Fukamachi discovers a mysterious metal object. Then in a blinding flash of light, Sho finds that he has accidentally fused with the Guyver, a mecha of mysterious alien design.\n\nNow, to save his girlfriend, Mizuki Segawa, along with the entire world, Sho must become the Guyver to fight the Chronos Corporation and their biocreatures, called Zoanoids, who are hell-bent on world domination."},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tokusatsu","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Denpa","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Torture","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Guyver: Out of Control","english":"Guyver: Out of Control","native":"強殖装甲ガイバー","romaji":"Kyoushoku Soukou Guyver","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"强殖装甲凯普 剧场版"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"強殖装甲ガイバー 劇場版"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Kyôsho